  VALUES (335, 4, $p1b_335$[{"t": "list", "id": "s6-3-1-b1", "imp": "core", "items": ["1、==网卡配置文件—文件路径==", "（1）==Linux 系统下，网卡相关配置信息有专门的配置文件存储。==", "（2）路径：", "==ls  /etc/sysconfig/network-scripts/==一般这个文件下第一个文件==ifcfg-ens33=="], "title": "", "ordered": false}, {"h": 260, "t": "img", "w": 1271, "id": "s6-3-1-b2", "imp": "normal", "src": "/kb-assets/skill/p163_r0_723e65eb187c8bf1.png", "title": "", "alt": "执行 ls /etc/sysconfig/network-scripts/ 与 cat ifcfg-ens33 查看网卡配置脚本截图", "caption": "进入 `/etc/sysconfig/network-scripts/` 查看默认以太网卡配置脚本 `ifcfg-ens33` 内容"}, {"t": "list", "id": "s6-3-1-b3", "imp": "core", "items": ["==cat /etc/sysconfig/network-scripts/ifcfg-ens33=="], "title": "", "ordered": false}, {"h": 371, "t": "img", "w": 498, "id": "s6-3-1-b4", "imp": "normal", "src": "/kb-assets/skill/p163_r1_aa1fc56519c0326d.png", "title": "", "alt": "cat 查看 CentOS 默认 ifcfg-ens33 动态获取 IP (BOOTPROTO=dhcp) 初始字段截图", "caption": "CentOS 7 网卡 `ifcfg-ens33` 初始默认配置详单：含 `BOOTPROTO=dhcp` 与 `ONBOOT=no` 核心项"}, {"t": "list", "id": "s6-3-1-b5", "imp": "core", "items": ["2、==网卡配置文件—初始配置状态=="], "title": "", "ordered": false}, {"h": 613, "t": "img", "w": 1350, "id": "s6-3-1-b6", "imp": "normal", "src": "/kb-assets/skill/p163_r2_55f2af87487dc2d7.png", "title": "", "alt": "VMware 虚拟网络编辑器 NAT 模式查看子网 IP 段、子网掩码及默认网关范围窗口截图", "caption": "通过 VMware 虚拟网络编辑器 NAT 设置面板获取所在网段 IP 范围、子网掩码与默认网关 IP"}, {"t": "list", "id": "s6-3-1-b7", "imp": "core", "items": ["3、==网卡配置文件—获取IP、网关等配置范围信息=="], "title": "", "ordered": false}, {"h": 586, "t": "img", "w": 1350, "id": "s6-3-1-b8", "imp": "normal", "src": "/kb-assets/skill/p164_r0_e569b8756000c8ba.png", "title": "", "alt": "ifcfg-ens33 改为静态 IP 核心参数标注：BOOTPROTO=static/ONBOOT=yes/IPADDR/NETMASK/GATEWAY/DNS1", "caption": "配置静态 IP 必修改及追加参数对照：`BOOTPROTO=static`、`ONBOOT=yes`、`IPADDR`、`NETMASK`、`GATEWAY`、`DNS1`"}, {"t": "list", "id": "s6-3-1-b9", "imp": "core", "items": ["4、==网卡配置文件—配置静态IP 信息=="], "title": "", "ordered": false}, {"h": 662, "t": "img", "w": 1350, "id": "s6-3-1-b10", "imp": "normal", "src": "/kb-assets/skill/p164_r1_f36be063a9cc95b9.png", "title": "", "alt": "vi 编辑 ifcfg-ens33 并执行 systemctl restart network 重启网络服务四步过程截图", "caption": "静态 IP 生效完整 4 步实操：`vi` 修改 `ifcfg-ens33` → 改 `BOOTPROTO=static` 与配静态地址 → `:wq` 存盘 → 重启网络服务"}, {"t": "list", "id": "s6-3-1-b11", "imp": "core", "items": ["5、==网卡配置文件—配置过程=="], "title": "", "ordered": false}, {"h": 625, "t": "img", "w": 1350, "id": "s6-3-1-b12", "imp": "normal", "src": "/kb-assets/skill/p165_r0_4b25abe99ee915f3.png", "title": "", "alt": "编辑完成静态网卡配置文件后终端验证网卡生效 IP 与网关通信状态截图", "caption": "修改并重启 `network` 服务后执行 `ip addr` 或 `ifconfig` 确认网卡成功绑定预设静态 IP"}, {"t": "list", "id": "s6-3-1-b13", "imp": "core", "items": ["6、==网卡配置文件—测试网络状态=="], "title": "", "ordered": false}, {"h": 644, "t": "img", "w": 1350, "id": "s6-3-1-b14", "imp": "normal", "src": "/kb-assets/skill/p165_r1_de1cbc8f4880cc4f.png", "title": "", "alt": "Linux 终端分别 ping 内网同网段网关与外网域名 www.baidu.com 校验网络连通截图", "caption": "连通性双步测试：先 `ping` 局域网网关（测本地通信），再 `ping www.baidu.com` 校验 DNS 与公网出口"}, {"t": "table", "id": "s6-3-1-t1", "imp": "core", "rows": [["`TYPE`", "`Ethernet`", "网卡链路类型，以太网"], ["`BOOTPROTO`", "`static`", "地址分配协议：==`static` 静态手工指定、`dhcp` 动态获取、`none` 不指定=="], ["`NAME` / `DEVICE`", "`ens33`", "网络连接名称与物理设备接口名"], ["`UUID`", "系统生成唯一串", "网卡唯一识别码"], ["`ONBOOT`", "`yes`", "==是否开机自动激活网卡，`yes` 启用、`no` 不激活（默认常为 `no`）=="], ["`IPADDR`", "`192.168.177.129`", "静态 IPv4 地址"], ["`NETMASK`", "`255.255.255.0`", "子网掩码（亦可写前缀 `PREFIX=24`）"], ["`GATEWAY`", "`192.168.177.2`", "默认网关 IP"], ["`DNS1` / `DNS2`", "`8.8.8.8` / `114.114.114.114`", "主用与备用 DNS 服务器"]], "title": "`ifcfg-ens33` 静态网卡核心配置字段详表", "headers": ["配置字段", "推荐值示例", "字段含义与考点说明"]}, {"t": "list", "id": "s6-3-1-b15", "imp": "core", "items": ["7、==DNS 配置文件—文件路径与配置=="], "title": "", "ordered": false}, {"h": 688, "t": "img", "w": 1350, "id": "s6-3-1-b16", "imp": "normal", "src": "/kb-assets/skill/p166_r0_abbf66045db41384.png", "title": "", "alt": "执行 cat 与 vi /etc/resolv.conf 配置 Linux DNS 解析服务器 name